  "label": "Hypersexualization",
  "description": "A derogatory stereotype that reduces individuals, particularly women, to their sexualized physical attributes, often implying that their value or worth is tied to their appearance or sexual availability. This concept is central to understanding the meme's intent, as the text 'stepped their game up' is used in a context that implies sexualization or hypersexualization of the female body.",
